  ],
  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a noun or with する to form a verb.\n- {返金|へんきん}する: to refund\n- {返金|へんきん}を{受|う}ける: to receive a refund\n- {返金|へんきん}を{求|もと}める: to request a refund\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {全額|ぜんがく}{返金|へんきん}: full refund\n- {一部|いちぶ}{返金|へんきん}: partial refund\n- {返金|へんきん}{保証|ほしょう}: money-back guarantee\n- {返金|へんきん}{対応|たいおう}: refund handling\n\nCONSUMER CONTEXT:\n- Japanese stores often have strict return policies\n- Online purchases typically have a {返品|へんぴん}・{返金|へんきん}{期間|きかん} (return/refund period)\n- Some stores only offer {交換|こうかん} (exchange) rather than refunds",
